WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.295
Delivery App Switcher has two main features.

00:00:03.295 --> 00:00:06.972
Its button blinks when a selected app sends a notification.

00:00:06.972 --> 00:00:10.390
You can also set it to open that app automatically.

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:13.888
Let’s start with blinking only.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:18.090
Turn on the top switch and leave automatic switching off.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:22.334
Vroong has sent a phone notification.

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:26.126
The green Vroong button is blinking.

00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:29.090
Tap it to open Vroong.

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:33.177
Now turn on automatic switching, too.

00:00:33.177 --> 00:00:38.390
When a selected app sends a notification, it opens about one second later.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:43.347
This time Vroong opens after the notification, without a tap.

00:00:43.347 --> 00:00:47.390
You still decide whether to accept the delivery.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:51.485
Delivery App Switcher is an independent app.

00:00:51.485 --> 00:00:56.560
It has no official affiliation or partnership with the operators of the apps shown.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:02.100
Search for “배달 앱전환” on Google Play and download the app.
